-- Presentation effects fire from the game loop, counted in frames: the timer
-- triggers them at frame 5, so frames 5-6 must carry a flash (covering the frame)
-- and a shake (jittering it) in BOTH engines, in the same order.
mode is "play"
time limit is 5 frames
when time runs out
  mode is "over"
  flash screen red for 4 frames
  shake camera for 6 frames by 3 pixels
to update
  tick is 1
to draw
  clear screen to black
  draw rect at 40, 40 size 20, 20 in green
  if mode is "over"
    write "hit!" at 40, 20 in white on hud
run game with update and draw
